  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"During three seasons passing, Truly Bone has become resolved at the end of 1998. The images are etching, aquatint spit bite, and drypoint from multiple copper plates using 16 colors. The letterpress type is Romulus 11 point, and the paper is cream Italian Alcantara. Sharing in the handwork and collaboration of printing are interns Ryan Ninete and Lynda Sock. Blue Heron Press (this time) is the artist's studio in Woods Hall, University of Nebraska-Lincoln."--Colophon.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
